abstract: "Lean-verified excess-at-most-fifteen cases of the original density inequality, a sharp auxiliary threshold at sixteen, and counterexamples to two auxiliary conjectures. The unrestricted Erdős problem remains open. AI assistance is disclosed in the accompanying bilingual paper."
